      "comment": "UNSTABLE MABLE (3) has a strong record this trip with four wins and three placings from nine starts. Was out of placings last time (20.25) at this track in a Grade 3/4, finishing seventh and beaten 10 lengths. Looks a leading chance on best. BABY SASS (6) turned in a moderate performance last time when seventh at Wanganui Straight over 313m behind Child Prodigy (17.59) in a Class 4. Worth another chance. CANYA CURRENCY (2) slotted in just off the lead from the wide box before lifting strongly to score (19.76) at this track in Mix 5 over 352m. One of the key runners again. BROTHER RONNY (1) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
